#
# Construct family: class disjointness asserted on an individual.
# x is typed into both disjoint classes B and C -> the ontology is INCONSISTENT.
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix ex:   <https://gmeow.example/dl/disjoint-instance#> .

ex: a owl:Ontology .

ex:B a owl:Class .
ex:C a owl:Class .
ex:B owl:disjointWith ex:C .

ex:x a owl:NamedIndividual , ex:B , ex:C .
